<p>Increases your maximum Feedback by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">10, 20, 30, 40, 50,</acronym> and increases the Feedback you gain from damage by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 25%, 34%, 42%, 50%</acronym> (to <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>character level 50">23%, 25%, 27%, 29%, 30%</acronym> of damage received).</p><p>The Feedback gain will scale with your Mindpower.</p>